[en.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_OLD]
Dark Sight Adaption

[en.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_OLD_desc]
The blinding light of the crystal has just been extinguished in this country. When the old nobles of the empire and the puny representatives of the mob were all wiped out, this country, which can finally open its eyes, still needs some time to recover its vision. Adapt and move forward in the dark. Under the rule of the great king, everything here is new.

[zh.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_OLD]
暗视适应

[zh.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_OLD_desc]
水晶的刺眼光芒在这个国家刚刚熄灭，当帝国的旧贵族和那些暴民可怜的小代表们被尽数铲除，这个终于可以睁开眼的国家，还需要一些时间来恢复视力。适应在黑暗中前行吧，在伟大的王统治下，这里的一切都是新的。
